Juno Castillo coordinates berth swaps and sailing diversions with Marcus Holt daily — reconciling construction closures against the master sailing grid. On **2026-05-15** ramp work forced Marcus to shift the **Friday Harbor run** to **Pier 5** boarding while **Pier 7 ramp** contractors cleared the approach before the **09:30 cutoff** commuter rush window. Juno attended the ops huddle alongside Elena Crane; Marcus published pier 5 diversion notices to terminal boards. Juno also references Marcus when enforcing back-to-back shift bans on Pier 9 berth 9B after gangway delivery day.

## Evidence

