## Use In Work

- Loop Marcus Holt before finalizing berth closures or passenger-facing diversion notices that affect scheduled sailings — Juno owns disruption comms but Marcus owns the master grid.
- When P7-RAMP or Pier 9 construction threatens morning boarding, propose pier diversions (e.g., Friday Harbor to Pier 5) rather than delaying commuter rush past 09:30.

## Limits

Marcus Holt sets sailing diversions and enforces contractor shift bans — he does not approve drydock windows (Elena Vasquez) or issue contractor badges (Fatima Okonkwo). Friday Harbor restoration to Pier 7 waits on ramp handover signing 2026-06-10.

